                                                "sense_id": "16e615e9-5c50-3441-a9a7-3205fe0b4f96",
                                                "text": "The hand is in the prone position typically when using a keyboard; and the forearm is then also in the prone position; when the foot is resting on the inner side of the sole, it is in the prone position."
                                            }
